# Week 10

Work completed:  
I did some work on the core code to make it easy to explain. I learned about how nested loops read each bar and note, how `bar  4 + offset` works to determine which note is in which bar, and how the modulo calculation and `getPlayhead()` control the sustain. Made some edits to the English comments, and recorded the explainer video.

